{"seq":4,"slug":"secrets-and-config-management","title":"密钥与配置管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering/platform-toolchain/secrets-and-config-management","wordCount":807,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"密钥与配置管理\">密钥与配置管理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>密钥与配置管理是平台工程中安全与便捷性交汇的关键领域。应用运行时需要数据库密码、API 密钥、TLS 证书等敏感信息，也需要功能开关、服务端点、资源限制等非敏感配置。如何安全地存储、分发和轮换这些信息，同时不增加开发者的认知负荷，是平台工程需要解决的核心问题。</p>\n<p>传统做法中，密钥散落在各种地方——环境变量、配置文件、CI/CD 变量甚至代码仓库中。这种分散管理带来安全风险（密钥泄露）和运维困难（密钥轮换需要逐个更新）。平台化的密钥管理将密钥集中存储在专用系统中，通过自动化机制安全地注入到应用运行时。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 密钥存储&#10;        A[HashiCorp Vault]&#10;        B[AWS Secrets Manager]&#10;        C[Azure Key Vault]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 同步层&#10;        D[External Secrets Operator]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Kubernetes&#10;        E[K8s Secret]&#10;        F[Pod 环境变量]&#10;        G[Volume 挂载]&#10;    end&#10;    A --&gt; D&#10;    B --&gt; D&#10;    C --&gt; D&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; G\">graph TB\n    subgraph 密钥存储\n        A[HashiCorp Vault]\n        B[AWS Secrets Manager]\n        C[Azure Key Vault]\n    end\n    subgraph 同步层\n        D[External Secrets Operator]\n    end\n    subgraph Kubernetes\n        E[K8s Secret]\n        F[Pod 环境变量]\n        G[Volume 挂载]\n    end\n    A --&gt; D\n    B --&gt; D\n    C --&gt; D\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; G</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>硬编码</th>\n<th>环境变量</th>\n<th>K8s Secret</th>\n<th>Vault + ESO</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>安全性</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>轮换能力</td>\n<td>手动改代码</td>\n<td>手动更新</td>\n<td>手动更新</td>\n<td>自动轮换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>审计追踪</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>有限</td>\n<td>完整审计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>访问控制</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>RBAC</td>\n<td>细粒度策略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加密存储</td>\n<td>明文</td>\n<td>明文</td>\n<td>Base64</td>\n<td>加密</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多环境管理</td>\n<td>分支管理</td>\n<td>逐环境配置</td>\n<td>逐集群配置</td>\n<td>中央化管理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"hashicorp-vault-架构\">HashiCorp Vault 架构</h2><p>Vault 是平台工程中最广泛使用的密钥管理系统。它提供密钥存储、动态密钥生成、加密即服务和身份认证等能力。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface VaultArchitecture {&#10;  secretEngines: {&#10;    kv: {&#10;      description: &#39;键值对存储（静态密钥）&#39;;&#10;      useCase: &#39;API 密钥、第三方服务凭证&#39;;&#10;      versioning: &#39;KV v2 支持版本历史&#39;;&#10;    };&#10;    database: {&#10;      description: &#39;动态数据库凭证生成&#39;;&#10;      useCase: &#39;应用连接数据库时动态获取临时凭证&#39;;&#10;      lifecycle: &#39;凭证自动过期、自动轮换&#39;;&#10;      benefit: &#39;消除长期静态数据库密码&#39;;&#10;    };&#10;    pki: {&#10;      description: &#39;PKI 证书签发&#39;;&#10;      useCase: &#39;服务间 mTLS 证书自动签发和轮换&#39;;&#10;      automation: &#39;cert-manager 集成自动续签&#39;;&#10;    };&#10;    transit: {&#10;      description: &#39;加密即服务&#39;;&#10;      useCase: &#39;应用数据加密/解密（不暴露密钥）&#39;;&#10;      benefit: &#39;密钥管理与应用逻辑分离&#39;;&#10;    };&#10;  };&#10;  authentication: {&#10;    kubernetes: {&#10;      method: &#39;Kubernetes ServiceAccount Token&#39;;&#10;      flow: &#39;Pod → K8s API → Vault → 返回 Token&#39;;&#10;      benefit: &#39;无需在 Pod 中预置任何凭证&#39;;&#10;    };&#10;    jwt: {&#10;      method: &#39;JWT/OIDC Token&#39;;&#10;      flow: &#39;CI/CD 系统 → JWT → Vault → 返回 Secret&#39;;&#10;      useCase: &#39;GitHub Actions / GitLab CI 访问 Vault&#39;;&#10;    };&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> VaultArchitecture</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  secretEngines</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    kv</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      description</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '键值对存储（静态密钥）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      useCase</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'API 密钥、第三方服务凭证'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      versioning</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'KV v2 支持版本历史'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    database</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      description</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '动态数据库凭证生成'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      useCase</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '应用连接数据库时动态获取临时凭证'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      lifecycle</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '凭证自动过期、自动轮换'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      benefit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '消除长期静态数据库密码'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    pki</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      description</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'PKI 证书签发'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      useCase</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '服务间 mTLS 证书自动签发和轮换'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      automation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'cert-manager 集成自动续签'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    transit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      description</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '加密即服务'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      useCase</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '应用数据加密/解密（不暴露密钥）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      benefit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '密钥管理与应用逻辑分离'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  authentication</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    kubernetes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      method</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Kubernetes ServiceAccount Token'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      flow</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Pod → K8s API → Vault → 返回 Token'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      benefit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '无需在 Pod 中预置任何凭证'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    jwt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      method</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'JWT/OIDC Token'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      flow</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'CI/CD 系统 → JWT → Vault → 返回 Secret'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      useCase</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'GitHub Actions / GitLab CI 访问 Vault'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# Vault 策略示例&#10;path &quot;secret/data/order-service/*&quot; {&#10;  capabilities = [&quot;read&quot;, &quot;list&quot;]&#10;}&#10;&#10;path &quot;database/creds/order-service-db&quot; {&#10;  capabilities = [&quot;read&quot;]&#10;}&#10;&#10;path &quot;pki/issue/order-service&quot; {&#10;  capabilities = [&quot;create&quot;, &quot;update&quot;]&#10;}&#10;&#10;# 动态数据库凭证配置&#10;vault write database/roles/order-service-db \\&#10;  db_name=production-postgres \\&#10;  creation_statements=&quot;CREATE ROLE \\&quot;{{name}}\\&quot; WITH LOGIN PASSWORD &#39;{{password}}&#39; VALID UNTIL &#39;{{expiration}}&#39;; GRANT SELECT, INSERT, UPDATE ON ALL TABLES IN SCHEMA public TO \\&quot;{{name}}\\&quot;;&quot; \\&#10;  default_ttl=&quot;1h&quot; \\&#10;  max_ttl=&quot;24h&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Vault 策略示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">path \"secret/data/order-service/*\" {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  capabilities = [\"read\", \"list\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">path \"database/creds/order-service-db\" {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  capabilities = [\"read\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">path \"pki/issue/order-service\" {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  capabilities = [\"create\", \"update\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 动态数据库凭证配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">vault write database/roles/order-service-db \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  db_name=production-postgres \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  creation_statements=\"CREATE ROLE \\\"{{name}}\\\" WITH LOGIN PASSWORD '{{password}}' VALID UNTIL '{{expiration}}'; GRANT SELECT, INSERT, UPDATE ON ALL TABLES IN SCHEMA public TO \\\"{{name}}\\\";\" \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  default_ttl=\"1h\" \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  max_ttl=\"24h\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Vault 的动态密钥是其核心差异化能力。应用不再使用固定的数据库密码，而是在需要时向 Vault 请求临时凭证。这些凭证自动过期，即使泄露也影响有限。</p>\n<h2 id=\"external-secrets-operator\">External Secrets Operator</h2><p>External Secrets Operator（ESO）是连接 Vault 与 Kubernetes 的桥梁。它自动将 Vault 中的密钥同步到 Kubernetes Secret，让应用以标准方式消费密钥。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# ExternalSecret 定义&#10;apiVersion: external-secrets.io/v1beta1&#10;kind: ExternalSecret&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: order-service-secrets&#10;  namespace: order-service&#10;spec:&#10;  refreshInterval: 1h&#10;  secretStoreRef:&#10;    name: vault-backend&#10;    kind: ClusterSecretStore&#10;  target:&#10;    name: order-service-secrets&#10;    creationPolicy: Owner&#10;  data:&#10;    - secretKey: DATABASE_URL&#10;      remoteRef:&#10;        key: secret/data/order-service/database&#10;        property: url&#10;    - secretKey: REDIS_URL&#10;      remoteRef:&#10;        key: secret/data/order-service/redis&#10;        property: url&#10;    - secretKey: STRIPE_API_KEY&#10;      remoteRef:&#10;        key: secret/data/order-service/stripe&#10;        property: api_key&#10;---&#10;# ClusterSecretStore 定义&#10;apiVersion: external-secrets.io/v1beta1&#10;kind: ClusterSecretStore&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: vault-backend&#10;spec:&#10;  provider:&#10;    vault:&#10;      server: &#39;https://vault.example.com&#39;&#10;      path: &#39;secret&#39;&#10;      version: &#39;v2&#39;&#10;      auth:&#10;        kubernetes:&#10;          mountPath: &#39;kubernetes&#39;&#10;          role: &#39;external-secrets&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># ExternalSecret 定义</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">external-secrets.io/v1beta1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ExternalSecret</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">order-service-secrets</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  namespace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">order-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  refreshInterval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">1h</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  secretStoreRef</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">vault-backend</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ClusterSecretStore</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">order-service-secrets</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    creationPolicy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Owner</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - 